© 2026 Dr. Lin Yu-Sheng. All rights reserved.

Healthcare professionals may print these materials for their own patients and
use them in clinical education, provided the content, attribution and source
references remain intact.

Any reproduction, redistribution, modification, translation, derivative use,
or commercial use requires prior written permission from the author.

These materials provide general patient education only. They do not replace
individual medical diagnosis, prescription or treatment advice, and contain no
dosing recommendations.
